      {
        "id": "tasty-goose-20",
        "name": "Example app links",
        "type": "htmlrenderer",
        "x": 1311,
        "y": 4862,
        "width": 320,
        "height": 220,
        "socketArray": [
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Html",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"HtmlType\"}",
            "data": "<div class=\"p-4 mb-8 rounded-theme border border-divider text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n  <span class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">You decide what runs.</span> Before an app you did not build starts, Tailrmade shows you what it can do: which sites it contacts, whether it reads your saved data, and whether it could cost money. Every node is open to read first.\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-foreground mb-4\">Apps and dashboards to try</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr))] gap-4 mb-8\">\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Bluesky%20live;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Bluesky live</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">A live dashboard of new Bluesky posts that mention your words</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Headache%20diary;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Headache diary</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Log headaches in a few taps and see your weekly pattern</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Mood%20journal;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Mood journal</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">A daily check-in that stays saved in your browser</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Simple%20weather%20app;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Simple weather app</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Type a city and see its weather right now</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Get%20dominant%20colors%20from%20images;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Get dominant colors from images</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Find the main colors in an image and theme the page with them</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Brand%20echo;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Brand echo</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">See how a brand name could look and sound in use</div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-foreground mb-4\">Make things with code and media</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr))] gap-4 mb-8\">\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Draw%20using%20third%20party%20packages;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Draw using third party packages</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Draw with npm packages like Observable Plot and three.js</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Generate%20a%20UV%20mapping%20texture;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Generate a UV mapping texture</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Make a UV checker texture and preview it on a 3D shape</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Extract%20video%20frames;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Extract video frames</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Lay out frames from a video as one image</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Shaders;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Shaders</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Adjust an image with a chain of shaders</div>\n  </a>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"font-bold text-xl text-foreground mb-4\">Learn how it works</h3>\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-[repeat(auto-fit,minmax(240px,1fr))] gap-4 mb-8\">\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;User%20interface%20gallery;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">User interface gallery</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Every piece a page can be made of: text, containers, inputs and more</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Access%20APIs;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Access APIs</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Chain requests to public APIs, each using the answer before it</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Graph%20examples;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Graph examples</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Three chart types, each drawn from a table</div>\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/?loadGraph=publicUser;;Node%20Update%20Behaviour;;Default\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"block p-4 bg-paper rounded-theme shadow border border-divider hover:bg-primary/10 no-underline\">\n    <div class=\"font-semibold text-foreground\">Node Update Behaviour</div>\n    <div class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground mt-1\">Learn when nodes run and update</div>\n  </a>\n</div>"
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Data",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"AnyType\"}",
            "data": {}
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Sanitize input",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"BooleanType\"}",
            "data": true,
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Template Passthrough",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"BooleanType\"}",
            "data": false,
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Templates",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"JSONType\"}",
            "data": {},
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "in",
            "name": "Background color",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"ColorType\"}",
            "data": {
              "r": 255,
              "g": 255,
              "b": 255,
              "a": 0
            },
            "visible": false
          },
          {
            "socketType": "out",
            "name": "Parsed Html",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"HtmlType\"}"
          },
          {
            "socketType": "out",
            "name": "ReactUI",
            "dataType": "{\"class\":\"DeferredReactType\"}"
          }
        ],
        "updateBehaviour": {
          "load": true,
          "update": true,
          "interval": false
        },
        "comment": "Written by hand for now, so it opens without a risk review. Update it when example apps change."
      },
